# CR 115.1d, ADR-0041: an activated ability on the stack is a target.
# human taps Prodigal Pyromancer to ping ai (stack item 1); ai responds with
# Stifle (TargetType$ Activated,Triggered) targeting that ability as stack:1.
# Stifle counters it (CounterEffect.java:270-272): the ability leaves the
# stack, no card moves, ai takes no damage, and the Pyromancer stays tapped
# for its cost.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana ai 2 U
queue targets ai
queue targets stack:1
queue action human activate 1 0
queue action ai cast 3
passpriority
